            "title": "民主黨期中選舉橫掃或打崩美股！美銀：恐跌逾10%、戳破AI泡沫",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"民主黨期中選舉橫掃或打崩美股！美銀：恐跌逾10%、戳破AI泡沫\" class=\"rounded-lg\" height=\"541\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6b6fc4e54b4ed0daca95485da327d94aecd764766b7d5739119b154234d7ff59/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2Fd4d59484fb843d974b6e63fc5389719b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">民主黨期中選舉橫掃或打崩美股！美銀：恐跌逾10%、戳破AI泡沫</figcaption></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B0%91%E4%B8%BB%E9%BB%A8%E6%9C%9F%E4%B8%AD%E9%81%B8%E8%88%89%E6%A9%AB%E6%8E%83%E6%88%96%E6%89%93%E5%B4%A9%E7%BE%8E%E8%82%A1-%E7%BE%8E%E9%8A%80-%E6%81%90%E8%B7%8C%E9%80%BE10-%E6%88%B3%E7%A0%B4ai%E6%B3%A1%E6%B2%AB-134003375.html",
